{"schema_version":"anthropic_style_subset_token_scores_v1","example_id":"q25_14b_joyful_01","primary_emotion":"joyful","secondary_emotion":"afraid","expected_emotions":["joyful","afraid"],"text":"Nina waited backstage at the school auditorium while students arranged music stands beneath the blue curtains. A loud crack came from the rigging above, and she ducked behind a piano as dust fell near the stage. Her heart hammered while staff inspected the ropes, and she kept one hand wrapped tightly around the exit rail. Once the area was cleared, the youngest orchestra played the opening piece perfectly for the first time. Nina sprang up laughing, clapped over her head, and hugged the conductor as the students cheered and stamped their feet. The concert continued with a smaller audience, and she carried a bright smile into every remaining song.","sentences":[{"sentence_index":0,"text":"Nina waited backstage at the school auditorium while students arranged music stands beneath the blue curtains.","char_start":0,"char_end":110,"expected_emotions":[]},{"sentence_index":1,"text":"A loud crack came from the rigging above, and she ducked behind a piano as dust fell near the stage.","char_start":111,"char_end":211,"expected_emotions":["afraid"]},{"sentence_index":2,"text":"Her heart hammered while staff inspected the ropes, and she kept one hand wrapped tightly around the exit rail.","char_start":212,"char_end":323,"expected_emotions":["afraid"]},{"sentence_index":3,"text":"Once the area was cleared, the youngest orchestra played the opening piece perfectly for the first time.","char_start":324,"char_end":428,"expected_emotions":["joyful"]},{"sentence_index":4,"text":"Nina sprang up laughing, clapped over her head, and hugged the conductor as the students cheered and stamped their feet.","char_start":429,"char_end":549,"expected_emotions":["joyful"]},{"sentence_index":5,"text":"The concert continued with a smaller audience, and she carried a bright smile into every remaining son